## Component Documentation

### ContextIndex
The main container component for the Hokusai documentation index.

Props:
- `title`: string - The main title of the documentation
- `description`: string - A brief description of the documentation's purpose

### FileList
A container component for listing all documentation files.

### FileItem
Represents a single documentation file in the index.

Props:
- `name`: string - The name of the file (without extension)
- `description`: string - A brief description of the file's contents
- `type`: 'overview' | 'flow' | 'process' | 'economics' | 'technical' | 'reference' | 'guidelines' - The category of the documentation

## Usage Example

```tsx
<ContextIndex
  title="Hokusai Protocol Documentation"
  description="Documentation for the Hokusai protocol"
>
  <FileList>
    <FileItem
      name="example_file"
      description="Example documentation file"
      type="technical"
    />
  </FileList>
</ContextIndex>
```

## Notes
- All file names should be in kebab-case
- File types should be one of the predefined categories
- Each file should have a clear, concise description
- File items should be organized by type and importance
